msgstr "Razlog za plačilo"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_form.html.twig:17
#: ../templates/default/helloasso_history.html.twig:119
msgid "Select a payment reason"
msgstr "Izberite razlog plačila"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_form.html.twig:53
msgid "Pay with HelloAsso"
msgstr "Plačajte s HelloAsso"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_form.html.twig:58
msgid "Secured payment"
msgstr "Zagotovljeno plačilo"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_form.html.twig:67
msgid ""
"We have chosen HelloAsso to process your payment. HelloAsso guarantees that "
"100% of your payment will be donated to our organization. You can support "
"the assistance they provide to organizations by leaving a voluntary "
"contribution to HelloAsso at the time of your payment."
msgstr ""
"Za obdelavo vašega plačila smo izbrali HelloAsso. HelloAsso zagotavlja, da "
"bo 100 % vašega plačila donirano naši organizaciji. Pomoč, ki jo nudijo "
"organizacijam, lahko podprete tako, da HelloAsso ob plačilu pustite "
"prostovoljni prispevek."

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_form.html.twig:73
msgid "No payment reasons are available."
msgstr "Razlogi za plačilo niso na voljo."

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_history.html.twig:29
#: ../templates/default/helloasso_history.html.twig:111
#: ../templates/default/helloasso_history.html.twig:168
