msgstr "Sprejmite nakazila SEPA"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:81
msgid "Amounts can be defined in the contributions types settings."
msgstr "Zneske je mogoče določiti v nastavitvah vrst prispevkov."

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:96
msgid ""
"Zero amounts, even if they are not disabled, are not proposed as a payment "
"reason on the form. You can disable this reason, or set a positive value in "
"the contributions types settings."
msgstr ""
"Ničelni zneski, tudi če niso onemogočeni, na obrazcu niso predlagani kot "
"plačilni razlog. Ta razlog lahko onemogočite ali nastavite pozitivno "
"vrednost v nastavitvah vrst prispevkov."

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:114
msgid "Connected to HelloAsso"
msgstr "Povezan s HelloAsso"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:116
