#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:150
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Kategorija"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:157
msgid "RNA Number"
msgstr "Številka RNA"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_preferences.html.twig:166
msgid ""
"HelloAsso helps organizations collect payments online and offers its "
"services free of charge. It covers all transaction fees so you can receive "
"all the money your audiences contribute, free of charge. The voluntary "
"contributions they leave are their sole source of income."
msgstr ""
"HelloAsso pomaga organizacijam zbirati plačila na spletu in ponuja svoje "
"storitve brezplačno. Pokriva vse transakcijske provizije, tako da lahko "
"brezplačno prejmete ves denar, ki ga prispeva vaše občinstvo. Prostovoljni "
"prispevki, ki jih pustijo, so njihov edini vir dohodka."

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_success.html.twig:15
msgid "Your payment has succeeded"
msgstr "Vaše plačilo je uspelo"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_success.html.twig:17
msgid "A receipt will be sent to you by email once it has been validated"
msgstr "Potrdilo vam bo poslano po e-pošti, ko bo potrjeno"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_success.html.twig:22
msgid "Amount paid"
msgstr "Plačan znesek"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_success.html.twig:25
msgid ""
"This amount does not include the voluntary contribution you could have made "
"to HelloAsso during payment"
msgstr ""
"Ta znesek ne vključuje prostovoljnega prispevka, ki bi ga lahko plačali "
"HelloAsso med plačilom"

#: ../templates/default/helloasso_success.html.twig:29
